{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-44-1","title":"Psalms 44:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The church, in memory of former favours, 7 complains of her present evils. 17 Professing her integrity, 24 she fervently prays for succour.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3294. B.C. 710. (Title.) for the sons. 42:1; *title have heard. 22:31; 71:18; 78:3-6; 105:1,2; Ex 12:24-27; 13:14,15; Isa 38:19 Joe 1:3 in the times. Nu 21:14-16,27-30; Job 8:8,9; 15:17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-2","title":"Psalms 44:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>drive out. 78:55; 80:8; 105:44; 135:10-12; 136:17-22; Ex 15:17,19; 34:11 De 7:1; Jos 10:42; 11:23; 21:43; Ne 9:22-27 how thou didst afflict, etc.Or, rather, \"how thou didst afflict the peoples (of Canaan,) and madest them (the Hebrews) to shoot forth;\" for {shalach} is to send forth in any manner, and is applied to a vine spreading its roots, etc. Ps 89:9; Eze 17:6; Jer 17:8; and this sense is parallel with plantedst in the former line.</p>\n<p>Ex 23:28; Nu 13:32; Jos 10:11; 24:12; 1Sa 5:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-3","title":"Psalms 44:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>For. De 4:37,38; 8:17,18; Jos 24:12; Zec 4:6; 2Co 4:7 thy right. 17:7; 20:6; 74:11; Ex 15:16; Isa 63:12 light. 42:5,11; 80:16 because. Nu 14:8; De 7:7,8; 1Sa 12:22; Mal 1:2,3; Ro 9:10-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-4","title":"Psalms 44:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>my king. 74:12; 89:18; 149:2; Isa 33:22 command. 42:8; Mr 1:25,26,31,41; 9:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-5","title":"Psalms 44:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Through thee. 18:39-42; 118:10-13; Isa 41:14-16; Php 4:13 push. De 33:17; 1Ki 22:11; Da 8:4 tread. 60:12; 91:13; 108:13; Zec 10:5; Ro 16:20; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-6","title":"Psalms 44:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>20:7; 33:16,17; Ho 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-7","title":"Psalms 44:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>But. 140:7; 144:10; Jos 1:5; 10:8-10,42; 11:6; 23:9,10; Jud 2:18; 7:4-7 1Sa 7:8-12; 14:6-10; 17:47; 2Sa 7:10 put them. 40:14; 83:1-18; 132:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-8","title":"Psalms 44:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>In God. 34:2; Isa 45:25; Jer 9:24; Ro 2:17; 1Co 1:29-31 praise. 115:1-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-9","title":"Psalms 44:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>43:2; 60:1,10; 74:1; 80:12,13; 88:14; 89:38-45; 108:11; Jer 33:24-26 La 3:31; 3:32; Ro 11:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-10","title":"Psalms 44:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Thou. Le 26:14,17,36,37; De 28:25; Jos 7:8,12; 1Sa 4:17; 31:1-7 spoil. 89:41; Isa 10:6,14; Jer 15:13; 20:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-11","title":"Psalms 44:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>given. Jer 12:3; Ro 8:36 like sheep appointed for meat. Heb. as sheep of meat. 14:4 scattered. 60:1; De 4:27; 28:64; 2Ki 17:6; Isa 11:11,12; Jer 32:37; Eze 34:12 Lu 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-12","title":"Psalms 44:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>sellest. De 32:30; Isa 50:1; 52:3,4; Jer 15:13 for nought. Heb. without riches. increase. Ne 5:8-12; Re 18:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-13","title":"Psalms 44:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>makest. 79:4; 80:6; 89:51; Jer 24:9; Eze 36:19-23 scorn. 123:3,4; Jer 48:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-14","title":"Psalms 44:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>by-word. De 28:37; 1Ki 9:7; 2Ch 7:20; Jer 24:9 shaking. 22:7; 2Ki 19:21; Job 16:4; Isa 37:22; La 2:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-15","title":"Psalms 44:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>confusion. Jos 7:7-9; Ezr 9:6; Jer 3:25 covered. 69:7; 71:13; 89:45; Jer 51:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-16","title":"Psalms 44:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>For the. 74:18,22,23; 79:12; Isa 37:3,4,17,23,24 enemy. 8:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-17","title":"Psalms 44:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>All this. Da 9:13 yet. 20; 9:17; De 6:12; 8:14; Isa 17:10; Jer 2:32 dealt. Jer 31:32; Eze 16:59; 20:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-18","title":"Psalms 44:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>heart. 78:57; 125:5; 1Ki 15:5; Job 34:27; Jer 11:10; Zep 1:6; Lu 17:32 have. 119:51,157; Job 23:11,12; 1Co 15:58; 1Th 2:10 steps. or, goings.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-19","title":"Psalms 44:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Though. 38:8; 60:1-3; Jer 14:17 in the. 74:13,14; Isa 27:1; 34:13,14; 35:7; Eze 29:3; Re 12:9; 13:2,11-13 Re 16:10 with the. 23:4; Job 3:5; 10:21,22; Mt 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-20","title":"Psalms 44:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>If we. 17; 7:3-5; Job 31:5-40 stretched. 68:31; Ex 9:29; 1Ki 8:22; Job 11:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-21","title":"Psalms 44:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Shall. 139:1-24; Job 31:4,14; 34:21,22; Jer 17:10; 23:24 knoweth. Jos 22:22,23; Ec 12:14; Ro 2:16; 1Co 4:5; Heb 4:12,13; Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-22","title":"Psalms 44:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Yea. Ro 8:36 killed. 11; 79:2,3; 1Sa 22:17-19; 1Ki 19:10; Mt 5:10-12; Joh 15:21 Joh 16:2,3; 1Co 4:9; 15:30,31; Re 11:3-9; 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-23","title":"Psalms 44:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Awake. 7:6; 12:5; 35:23; 59:4,5; 78:65; Isa 51:9; Mr 4:38 cast. 9; 74:1; 88:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-24","title":"Psalms 44:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Wherefore. 10:1,11; 13:1; 43:1-4; De 32:20; Job 13:24 forgettest. 74:19,23; Ex 2:23,24; Isa 40:27,28; Re 6:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-25","title":"Psalms 44:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>66:11,12; 119:25; Isa 51:23; La 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-44-26","title":"Psalms 44:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>for our help. Heb. a help for us. redeem. 26:11; 130:7,8</p>"}]}